  "issues": [
    "Worst-case savings (every result retrieved) is 24.2% — the store is a NET WASH when the LLM retrieves every result. The win is in the realistic case (10% retrieval rate).",
    "read_file accuracy is 93.3% (not 100%) — for very large files the needle may not be in top-10 chunks. Function-body-aligned chunking would help.",
    "Embeddings cold-load is ~150ms — first add() pays the model load. Amortized over a long session.",
    "@xenova/transformers pulls in sharp (image processing) — stubbed out. Future integration must declare @xenova/transformers as optional dependency.",
    "LLM accuracy check returned 10% YES — the followup is too demanding for search_code. Test design issue, not store issue.",
    "500-tool-call test takes ~10 minutes — embeddings batch computation at add() is the bottleneck.",
    "pickNeedle for grep patterns starting with 'function\\s+' extracts 'function' instead of the function name — fixed in experiment runner."
